<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weaker on dollar, firms on pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weaker on dollar, firms on pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee was fixed weaker against the dollar but firmer on the pound on Wednesday, forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was quoted at a mean commercial rate of 20.2565 against the dollar from 20.2140 on Tuesday. The rupee traded at a mean rate of 32.6875 versus the pound from 32.7075 on Tuesday.</p>
